        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"5de7f95b-ccad-41b2-9f63-a13f7c1d9f09\",\"review_text\":\"We are boycotting Swedish app in our protest against Sweden for their desrecpect & desceration of our holy book Qur'an\"},{\"review_id\":\"de48c99b-46fe-4837-8634-e63dbc72a5ea\",\"review_text\":\"I LOVE that I was able to put in only a few songs I like and Spotify gave me recommendations for an AWESOME Playlist...!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa573851-0b86-4b1b-adf6-210268c08d2a\",\"review_text\":\"I absolutely love Spotify, to me is one of the best Music Apps. Great job Spotify!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"372d4e67-59cc-4c54-879f-3e8a202ee554\",\"review_text\":\"Please ye ads ko thoda kumm Karo harr ek song ke baad ad 🙏🙄\"},{\"review_id\":\"47f1406d-4918-4d60-9647-5ca8e610caca\",\"review_text\":\"Very poor updates as we cannot playback the songs and most bad updates are happening it is affecting the spotify quality\"},{\"review_id\":\"82780cbe-6435-4efb-84f6-8e5fa47ffc3a\",\"review_text\":\"Awesomeness 👌 👏 👍 😍 💖\"},{\"review_id\":\"36609c5c-fe48-4459-86b8-cc78fd3c77cd\",\"review_text\":\"Bheekhmangon\"},{\"review_id\":\"f4c8146a-d5c8-4168-b00e-21af666afc6a\",\"review_text\":\"Unconditional love, Stoli Canales\"},{\"review_id\":\"3ddb3f4e-f7b9-430b-b335-eadc6d321f46\",\"review_text\":\"Deleting this App. The new update suck, we can't choose our fvrt songs after some clicks, we can't CHOOSE song after a song played, and we can't turn off shuffle option. They are pushing us to upgrade to Premium subscription. No wonder if you guys loose ratings and users. Anyway i am deleting this app after years of using.\"},{\"review_id\":\"16d640e9-b281-4746-9562-c7dbcf7126b6\",\"review_text\":\"It's my best music app but now it's not...everything basic features is premium....\"}]}"
